# oracle-inputs: w12tip4p_long_water.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 3.3e-13, atoms 5.5e-12.
# oracle: pppm/tip4p (27 rigid TIP4P/2005 waters, as w12tip4p_long) with the collective, fftbench, overlap, minorder and cutoff/adjust keywords (accepted, no effect with one process)
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
read_data       w12tip4p_long_water.data
pair_style      lj/cut/tip4p/long 1 2 1 1 0.1546 8.5
pair_coeff      1 1 0.1852 3.1589
pair_coeff      1 2 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      2 2 0.0 1.0
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 450.0 0.9572
angle_style     harmonic
angle_coeff     1 55.0 104.52
kspace_style    pppm/tip4p 1.0e-5
kspace_modify   gewald 0.37833912 mesh 12 12 12 order 5 collective yes fftbench yes overlap no minorder 2 cutoff/adjust yes
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep        1.0
fix             1 all shake 1.0e-10 200 0 b 1 a 1
fix             2 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe evdwl ecoul elong press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             50
